  Copyright fatedier and the frp project contributors
  License: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/fatedier/frp

* nezha-agent (Nezha monitoring agent)
  Copyright naiba and the nezha project contributors
  License: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/nezhahq/agent

* Serverstatus client (stat_client, Serverstatus-Rust)
  Copyright zdz and the Serverstatus-Rust project contributors
  License: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/zdz/Serverstatus-Rust

* cloudflared (Cloudflare Tunnel client)
  Copyright Cloudflare, Inc.
  License: Apache License 2.0 (with the Cloudflare trademark notice)
  https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared

* tailcat (Tailscale control-plane-free P2P encrypted tunnel tool)
  Copyright Tailscale Inc. & contributors
